Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Good morning, Atty. Tolosa.

33
00:14:25,660 --> 00:14:27,840
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: The clerk is directed to administer the oath.

34
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:31,540
Atty. Renato N. Bantug Jr.: Sir, please sign up and raise your right hand.

35
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:33,480
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: pwede kayong umupo Atty. Adalin, ah, Engineer Adalin.

36
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:46,740
Atty. Renato N. Bantug Jr.: You, Jaime Adalin, do swear that the evidence you shall give in the case now pending between the Philippines and Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte shall be the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth. So help you God.

37
00:14:49,750 --> 00:14:54,070
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Atty. Adalin, pakisagot po sa mikropono para marinig po at malagay sa record.

38
