Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Ano po ang inyong mas maikling pangalan? Engineer Adalin.

41
00:15:04,420 --> 00:15:07,460
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: I am Jaime Gallinero Adalin, sir.

42
00:15:07,900 --> 00:15:09,220
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Ano po ang inyong palayaw?

43
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:10,960
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Jimmy po.

44
