1032
03:48:37,780 --> 03:48:38,400
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, Your Honor.

1033
03:48:39,450 --> 03:48:42,810
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: January 25, 2026, saan ka bumiyahe?

1034
03:48:43,200 --> 03:48:50,020
