1291
04:24:48,850 --> 04:24:50,110
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, I will request.

1292
04:24:50,690 --> 04:24:57,350
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Yes, and please ask them to submit to the court within this hour at the latest within the day. Laging salamat, Engineer.

1293
04:24:57,790 --> 04:24:58,530
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Thank you, Your Honor.

1294
04:24:58,690 --> 04:25:00,150
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Laging salamat po, Mr. Presiding Officer.

1295
04:25:00,410 --> 04:25:03,150
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator Judge Riza. What is the pleasure of Senator Judge Kiko?

1296
04:25:04,490 --> 04:25:05,670
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You may proceed, sir.

1297
04:25:05,750 --> 04:25:08,450
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Thank you. Magandang hapon, Engineer.

1298
04:25:08,940 --> 04:25:09,880
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Magandang hapon po.

1299
04:25:09,970 --> 04:25:28,400
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Kanina, nung ikaw ay nag-testify, tinanong sa'yo tungkol dito sa titulo o yung property na nasa SALN at yung property description na nasa deed of sale. At sinabi mo, one and the same. Tama?

1300
04:25:28,810 --> 04:25:30,830
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, Your Honor.

1301
04:25:30,970 --> 04:25:42,230
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Sabi mo, one and the same. Sinabi mo, nakakatiyak ka na yung lupa na nakalagay doon sa SALN, yun din yung lupa na nakalagay doon sa deed of sale, tama?

1302
04:25:42,590 --> 04:25:44,230
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, Your Honor, based on the eCAR.

1303
04:25:44,450 --> 04:25:54,770
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Yes. Ngayon, nung ipinakita sa iyo yung picture ng prime dining, sabi mo hindi mo alam kung yun ba, tama?

1304
04:25:58,360 --> 04:26:07,500
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: So paano mo masasabing tiyaka na yun yung property nung ipinakita sa iyo ay hindi mo alam?

1305
04:26:07,840 --> 04:26:15,960
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yun po kasing picture, parang may pangalan. Kasi yung signage or yung business name, hindi po ako pamilyar doon. So

1306
04:26:15,960 --> 04:26:16,760
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: in other words...

1307
04:26:18,350 --> 04:26:54,710
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Yung sinabi mong tiyak ka na yung nasa SALN at yung nasa DDoS sale ay iisa, hindi mo pala alam. Kasi nung pinakita sa'yo, hindi mo alam eh. Pero nung pagkatapos ng lunch, tinanong sa'yo, sabi mo, kinausap mo yung tao mo, yun pala. So bakit pabago-bago? Tiyak ka, hindi ka tiyak. Tapos ngayon tiyak ka na naman dahil nagtanong ka dun sa mga tao mo. So ano yung totoo? Ano yung hindi totoo? Ano yung tiyak? Ano yung hindi tiyak?

1308
04:26:56,430 --> 04:27:02,590
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yan po kasi yung picture kanina na pinakita na merong name ng business.

1309
04:27:05,110 --> 04:27:06,270
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Doon pa ako hindi sure.

1310
04:27:07,790 --> 04:27:09,090
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Kasi normally...

1311
04:27:09,090 --> 04:27:33,990
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Kasi kung tiyak ka, di dapat nung nakita mo, alam mo. Sabi mo yun yung iisan... Iisa yun eh, di ba? Iisa yung nasa SALN na description, iisa rin yung nandun sa deed of sale. So sabi mo, tiyak. Pero nung nakita yung property, sabi mo, hindi mo alam. Tapos nung nagtanong ka, yun pala. Alam mo pala. Alam mo na.

1312
04:27:34,820 --> 04:28:00,000
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Kasi po, yung picture na pinakita lately na walang nakalagay na business name, Ayun din po nakita ko doon sa picture na sinambit sa amin ng aming mga appraiser. Usually take pictures eh. Pero kung nakalagay yung signage na yun ang business niya, doon ako hindi sure. Kasi ang picture po namin, wala namang ganun nakalagay na bistro. Ano ba yun nakalagay doon?

1313
04:28:00,100 --> 04:28:02,240
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: So ano yung totoo? Sure, hindi sure?

1314
04:28:02,680 --> 04:28:03,880
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Pardon? Pardon sir?

1315
04:28:04,160 --> 04:28:13,300
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: So what is, ano talaga ang totoo? Sure ka dahil sinabi mong tiya ka tapos hindi ka sure? Tapos ngayon, sure ka na ulit. Ano ba?

1316
04:28:13,460 --> 04:28:21,340
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yung picture po na pinakita na walang name ng business, doon ako sure na talagang yun siya.

1317
04:28:23,160 --> 04:28:28,770
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Magkaiba kasi sila eh.

1318
04:28:28,770 --> 04:28:29,080
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Pero ngayon, magtanong ka, di mo alam, ngayon alam

1319
04:28:29,080 --> 04:28:53,880
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: mo na. Anyway, I have no further questions. Just a observation that clearly, there are inconsistencies in your testimony. Forgive me, Engineer, but you say one thing and then you say another thing. So we are wondering, ano ba talaga ang totoo sa sinasabi mo? Just for the record, Mr. President.

1320
04:28:55,200 --> 04:28:59,920
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you. Finally, Senator Judge Erwin Tulfo for his... Raffy?

1321
04:29:02,420 --> 04:29:08,460
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Senator Raffy Tulfo, rather, for his second round. Apologies, Senator Judge Raffy. You may proceed, sir. You have two minutes.

1322
04:29:17,420 --> 04:29:19,980
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Just like what Senator...

1323
04:29:24,270 --> 04:29:37,270
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: There's nothing wrong for anybody to go to China. Pero kung nang-sponsor is Chinese government, then may problema. Kaya yun ang tinatanong ko ngayon.

1324
04:29:39,760 --> 04:29:43,460
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Sino po ang nag-sponsor ng trip niya sa China? Would you know?

1325
04:29:43,920 --> 04:29:45,860
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Personal travel po namin yan, Your Honor.

1326
04:29:46,440 --> 04:29:48,940
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Personal travel. Ilan kayo?

1327
04:29:51,120 --> 04:29:54,810
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Para mga 6 ato o 7?

1328
04:29:55,350 --> 04:30:05,210
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: 6-7. So pinag-usapan nyo 7 kayo na mag-travel sa channel. On a personal matter, is that what it is?

1329
04:30:05,430 --> 04:30:06,890
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, correct, Your Honor.

1330
04:30:07,150 --> 04:30:26,360
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: And then, same thing noong November 2018? Kasi noong November 2018, two days lang. And then noong January 25, 26, five days lang. So all of these are personal money ninyo?

1331
04:30:26,740 --> 04:30:27,620
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, Your Honor.

1332
04:30:27,880 --> 04:30:29,520
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Sino-sino po ulit ang mga kasama nyo?

1333
04:30:31,180 --> 04:30:40,960
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: If I can recall, yung January, nakasama po namin yung aming administrator and city engineer and city treasurer.

1334
04:30:41,200 --> 04:30:42,940
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So naka-declare to sa inyong travel authority?

1335
04:30:44,900 --> 04:30:45,500
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes.

1336
04:30:45,820 --> 04:30:48,200
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Na you are using personal funds?

1337
04:30:48,920 --> 04:30:50,200
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, Your Honor.

1338
04:30:50,220 --> 04:30:54,280
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Sa plane ticket and all? At kayo po mismo ang bumili ng plane ticket?

1339
04:30:54,580 --> 04:30:55,300
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, Your Honor.

1340
04:30:55,660 --> 04:30:58,060
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: At which travel agency ito?

1341
04:30:59,690 --> 04:31:12,050
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Yes. Kasi kayo mismo pumunta sa travel agency? para bumili ng ticket. Or somebody bought your tickets through the travel agency or the travel agency bought the tickets for you guys?

1342
04:31:13,250 --> 04:31:15,490
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: What I can recall is...

1343
04:31:15,490 --> 04:31:17,970
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Anong pangalan ng travel agency at the same time follow-up ko?

1344
04:31:18,310 --> 04:31:19,050
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Pardon sir?

1345
04:31:20,310 --> 04:31:27,350
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi ikaw ba mismo pumunta sa PAL para bumili ng ticket o gumamit ka ng travel agency?

1346
04:31:28,520 --> 04:31:38,700
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: If I can recall, nag-assign kami ng isang tao to facilitate the procurement of the ticket, Your Honor.

1347
04:31:40,040 --> 04:31:46,920
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So meron kayong tao ang kinausap para mag-facilitate ng tickets ninyo?

1348
04:31:47,580 --> 04:31:49,340
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: As a group, Your Honor.

1349
04:31:49,540 --> 04:31:50,740
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So group to rito?

1350
04:31:50,920 --> 04:31:51,420
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes.

1351
04:31:51,580 --> 04:31:57,660
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So ibig sabihin dumaan kayo sa travel agency? Kasi kung group to, travel agency yan eh. Most probably yun.

1352
04:31:59,180 --> 04:32:00,620
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Anong pangalan po ng travel agency?

1353
04:32:01,790 --> 04:32:03,110
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Hindi ko talaga ma-memorize.

1354
04:32:03,410 --> 04:32:05,770
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Diyan ka na naman. Nagkakaroon ka ng amnesia. Of

1355
04:32:05,770 --> 04:32:23,290
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: course, you should know that. Kasi sabi mo, group kayo. Siyempre, kung pera ninyo yan, alamin nyo kung anong pangalan ng travel agency para makatipid kayo. Mahal ba yan? O kilala ba yung travel agency na yan? O dati pa, palpak na yan. Marami na ginagawa ang kalukuan. E maghanap tayo ng magandang travel agency. Ganon dapat. Engineer ka pa man din. Kung baga, kung ano nang sabihin ng mga kasama mo, bahala na.

1356
04:32:25,250 --> 04:32:32,910
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Am I allowed to... Kung baga to furnish officially kung after checking, pwede po ba yan?

1357
04:32:33,130 --> 04:32:38,750
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Yes, pwede po yan. Siguro. Mr. Presiding Officer, pwede ba mag-furnish na siya after checking yung pangalan travel agency?

1358
04:32:39,070 --> 04:32:40,190
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Para sigurado lang po.

1359
04:32:42,570 --> 04:32:44,550
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: When, Engineer Jimmy?

1360
04:32:45,270 --> 04:32:48,630
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Upon going back to the office, Your Honor.

1361
04:32:49,960 --> 04:32:57,000
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: With the permission of Senator Judge Raffy, he can just simply inform the Clerk of Court if that is okay with him.

1362
04:32:57,450 --> 04:32:58,970
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: That's okay with me. Okay.

1363
04:32:59,950 --> 04:33:08,530
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kindly, the clerk is directed to kindly coordinate with Engineer Jimmy for the travel agency, name of the travel agency concerned.

1364
04:33:09,070 --> 04:33:09,930
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, Yon.

1365
04:33:09,970 --> 04:33:10,510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you.

1366
04:33:10,710 --> 04:33:18,150
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Noong 2018, personal expenses, personal money din ang ginamit nyo, pagpunta ng China din.

1367
04:33:21,450 --> 04:33:22,130
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: 2018?

1368
04:33:22,550 --> 04:33:29,760
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Yes, November 12, 2018, PR356 going to China, personal... Money pa rin nyo yan?

1369
04:33:30,200 --> 04:33:32,680
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Yes, I'm very sure it's personal money.

1370
04:33:32,840 --> 04:33:39,080
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So mahilig ka palang pumunta ang China on your personal... Sino kasama mo pala nitong November 2018? At bakit two days lang po?

1371
04:33:40,390 --> 04:33:49,320
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Wait, I can't recall. There was a travel in China na parang sister city.

1372
04:33:52,000 --> 04:33:53,440
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Mayroon po kaming travel na ganun.

1373
04:33:53,620 --> 04:34:00,740
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Kaya nga po, bakit two days lang? Napakabilis ata. At personal travel lang yun? Kumbaga, magbabakasyon ako pero two days lang.

1374
04:34:02,440 --> 04:34:07,160
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So, again, ulitin ko, personal to o may nag-sponsor?

1375
04:34:08,680 --> 04:34:13,980
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Siguro, baka pwedeng, I will submit official document para sigurado lang po tayo.

1376
04:34:14,000 --> 04:34:14,540
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Very good.

1377
04:34:15,930 --> 04:34:20,350
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Same ruling, Senator Judge Raffy. The Clerk of Court is directed to coordinate with

1378
04:34:20,350 --> 04:34:20,850
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Engineer Jimmy. Alam mo, Engineer,

1379
04:34:21,210 --> 04:34:39,360
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: kaya kita tinatanong tungkol sa China travel. Dahil si VP, yung colleague, Cali88 na kung saan partner dito si Tony Carpio na asba ni Sara Duterte at isa

1380
04:34:39,360 --> 04:35:12,130
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: sa mga co-owners. Nakatanggap ng 319 million pesos yung Cali88. Inward remittance from China and Hong Kong. So hindi maganda pakinggan. Malaman ng mga Pilipino na tumatanggap ang isang government official, especially napakataas yung katungkulan sa ating gobyerno, tumanggap ng salapi mula sa China na kung saan ay nagkakaroon tayo ng hidwaan sa West Philippine Sea. Gets? Salamat po.

1381
04:35:12,660 --> 04:35:17,950
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator Judge Raffy. Senator Judge Bam Aquino is recognized. You have two minutes, sir.

1382
04:35:20,050 --> 04:35:27,190
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Maraming salamat, Mr. Presiding Officer. My question is for the prosecution initially. Magandang araw, Atty. Tolosa.

1383
04:35:27,310 --> 04:35:28,570
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Good afternoon, Your Honor.

1384
04:35:28,710 --> 04:35:53,870
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. Nais ko lang kasing iibalik yung diskusyon dun sa properties. So, can you refresh our memory? From the prosecution's perspective, meron po bang property na pagmamayari ni Vice President? Duterte o ng kanyang asawa na hindi po nakalagay sa SALN. What is the position of the prosecution?

1385
04:35:54,310 --> 04:36:06,810
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Yes, Your Honor. As testified to by the Register of Deeds of the City of Davao, that is the property covered by TCT No. 146-202401-0775.

1386
04:36:07,090 --> 04:36:08,850
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Ito yung pinag-uusapan natin ngayong araw?

1387
04:36:09,010 --> 04:36:09,550
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

1388
04:36:09,590 --> 04:36:13,730
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So isa lang ang isang property ang nakita ninyo na wala sa kanyang SALN?

1389
04:36:14,010 --> 04:36:16,770
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Yes, Your Honor. That was the property identified by the RD, Your Honor.

1390
04:36:16,790 --> 04:36:21,890
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. One property in Davao City. Meron bang property sa Samal?

1391
04:36:21,990 --> 04:36:22,550
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

1392
04:36:22,710 --> 04:36:33,010
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So, could you tell us the, in your, sa position po ng prosecution, ilang properties ang hindi na deklara ni Vice President Sara sa kanyang sale?

1393
04:36:33,150 --> 04:36:40,350
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Yes, based on what has been presented by our witnesses, one in the city of Davao and another one, Your Honor, in the...

1394
04:36:42,070 --> 04:36:46,150
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Igakos, or the island garden of Samal, Your Honor.

1395
04:36:46,210 --> 04:36:51,110
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay, so we're talking about two properties. Yung susunod na witness, yun yung sa Samal.

1396
04:36:51,170 --> 04:36:51,950
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: We believe so, Your Honor.

1397
04:36:52,010 --> 04:37:06,570
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So right now, ang defense, ang posisyon nila, parehas yung nakalagay na Barangay 74A dito sa pinag-uusapan natin. Ang posisyon nyo, hindi ito magkaparehas.

1398
04:37:06,850 --> 04:37:10,030
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: That is correct, Your Honor, because of the glaring discrepancies between the two.

1399
04:37:10,230 --> 04:37:38,540
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So pag minatch ninyo yung mga properties sa Davao sa Register of Deeds at sa SALN, lampas ba dun sa dami ng nadeklara niyang property o parehas ang numero? Do you understand my question? Kunyari kung 19 yan, 19 rin ba yung Register of Deeds, 19 rin yung sa SALN o 20 yung nasa Register of Deeds at 19 yung sa SALN? For example.

1400
04:37:38,880 --> 04:37:58,800
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Yes. We were not able to check all of the properties with the RD. But because the point is, even if the witness will present that summary of all properties under the name of the spouses,

1401
04:37:59,040 --> 04:37:59,380
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Yes.

1402
04:37:59,900 --> 04:38:39,980
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: That will only cover properties which they already transferred under their names. So it will not cover properties which they did not yet transfer under their name. So it is possible that this property indicated in the SALN was not yet transferred under their name. So it will not be reflected. in any summary that he will produce. It's the same thing, Your Honor. For example, even if the Vice President admitted she has financial interest in GenCorp, if you check the GIS, she will not be reflected as a stockholder or director, but still, she admitted that she has interest there.

1403
04:38:40,260 --> 04:38:51,900
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. Sige. Magkaiba yung... Yung Gen Corp. At medyo baka iba to kasi ito mabibilang natin eh. Mabibilang mo yung dami ng lupa, mabibilang mo yung nakarehistro, mabibilang mo yung nasa SALN.

1404
04:38:52,820 --> 04:39:46,530
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So, anyway, again, we're not supposed to do the work of the defense or the prosecution. Pero siguro po, hiningin na rin ni Sen. Risa yung mga detalye ng lahat ng properties sa Davao City ni Mans Carpio, Sara Duterte Carpio, or Joint. Pag na-submit na po yun, magandang mabangga natin yan dun sa SALN, makita natin yung dami ng mga properties para makita natin ano ba yung probability. Kasi sabi ng witness, highly probable, probable, possible. Pero siguro pag nandyan na po yung datos, pag na-submit nyo na po yan sa clerk of court at may presenta po sa amin, mas magiging malinaw kung ano ba itong pinag-uusapan nating loting ito. Kung ito ba'y labis. Doon sa nakarehistro o kulang ba ito sa mga nakalagay sa SALN? Maraming salamat, Mr. President Officer. Thank you.

1405
04:39:46,570 --> 04:40:37,000
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you very much, Senator Judge Bam Aquino. There being no other Senator Judges who wishes to make interjections, before I excuse Engineer Jimmy, without raising the hopes of some of the Senator Judges, even if Engineer Jimmy submits the list, As pointed out by Attorney Tolosa earlier, and as which we have seen earlier, ang babanggitin sa mga title, technical description lamang naman na kailangan ibangga dun sa pangalan lamang ng barangay na binabanggit sa SALN. So, it'll still be the same position that we will find ourselves in after we get the list because kailangan mo pa rin banggain yung nakalagay sa TCT na technical description lamang, wala namang house and street number, kumpara sa barangay na nakalagay sa SALN.

1406
04:40:37,540 --> 04:40:38,020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Anyway,

1407
04:40:38,070 --> 04:40:50,090
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: we would like to thank you, Engineer Jimmy, para po sa inyong oras, panahon at pagsagot sa mga katanungan at pagupo bilang testigo sa hukumang ito. Maraming salamat po. You're excused, sir.

1408
04:40:50,310 --> 04:40:51,170
Engr. Jaime G. Adalin: Maraming salamat po.

1409
04:40:52,940 --> 04:41:03,080
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: As agreed upon by the parties, as stated by the Chair earlier, we shall adjourn at this point and shall resume tomorrow morning at 10 a.m. for the direct examination of

1410
04:41:05,580 --> 04:41:23,540
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Engineer John Kenneth Enumerables. Thereafter, the City Accountant, Ms. Bahan. And thereafter, the Punong Barangay. Trial is adjourned until tomorrow at 10 a.m.
